  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut potato into fries.\n• Place on lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Bake until tender, 20-25 mins.\n• Meanwhile, grate carrot. Drain and rinse black beans. Halve continental rolls.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65bb443203a5929119520390-0793bcfe.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook black beans until softened, 2-3 mins.\n• Stir in Mexican seasoning and tomato paste and cook, until fragrant, 1 min.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65bb443203a5929119520390-6ea77256.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir in the water, brown sugar, BBQ sauce and butter, and simmer until slightly reduced, 1-2 mins.\n• Lightly mash beans with a potato masher or fork. Season.\n• Remove from heat, and sprinkle with Cheddar cheese. Cover with a lid or foil and cook until melted, 2-3 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65bb443203a5929119520390-1e0ea1e9.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, bake continental rolls directly on a wire oven rack until heated through, 2-3 mins.\n• In a medium bowl, combine carrot, salad leaves and a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Season.\n• Divide fries, toasted rolls and carrot salad between plates.\n• Top rolls with cheesy bean chilli.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65bb443203a5929119520390-892a7405.jpeg"
    }
  ]
